{
  "doc": [
    "The shared guard-matching cases. The Python matcher (moxi_turns.guards.run, the Codex host's) and the Claude runner's matcher both run every case, so the two can't drift.",
    "guards: each guard as the endpoint declares it, in table order, with calls per harness and deadline_ms before the clamp. A harness's table entry is the guard with calls replaced by calls[harness] and deadline_ms by min(deadline_ms, max_wait_ms); a guard with no calls for the harness is not in that table.",
    "cases: harness, tool, agent (null or empty for the main loop), input, on (the ids in the table, kept in table order). Expected: covering (ids in table order), decision 'next' (no trip), 'deny' (a data-only guard refused; deny is its text) or 'ask' (ask holds the judge ids sent on /ask/guard).",
    "Rules: a pattern matches the whole tool name, * any run of characters, every other character only itself. who main: no agent; agents: an agent; any: both. Every match regex must find its input field, which must be a string; match_flags 'i' is case-blind; regexes compile without Unicode classes (Python re.ASCII, JavaScript with no u flag). The first covering data-only guard denies with no trip, even when judge guards also cover. Codex names are canonical only."
  ],
  "max_wait_ms": 3000,
  "guards": [
    {"id": "t.shell-rm", "calls": {"claude": ["Bash"], "codex": ["Bash"]}, "who": "any",
     "match": {"command": "\\brm\\b"}, "match_flags": "", "judge": true, "deny": "",
     "wants": [], "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.nested", "calls": {"claude": ["Agent", "Task"], "codex": ["spawn_agent"]},
     "who": "agents", "match": null, "match_flags": "", "judge": false,
     "deny": "subagents may not start subagents", "wants": [], "on_error": "allow",
     "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.calendar", "calls": {"claude": ["mcp__*Google_Calendar__*"], "codex": ["mcp__*Google_Calendar__*"]},
     "who": "any", "match": null, "match_flags": "", "judge": false,
     "deny": "the calendar tools are off here", "wants": [], "on_error": "allow",
     "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.ceiling", "calls": {"claude": ["*"], "codex": ["*"]}, "who": "agents",
     "match": null, "match_flags": "", "judge": true, "deny": "", "wants": [],
     "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 5000},
    {"id": "t.push", "calls": {"claude": ["Bash"], "codex": ["Bash"]}, "who": "any",
     "match": {"command": "^git\\s+push\\b"}, "match_flags": "i", "judge": true, "deny": "",
     "wants": [], "on_error": "deny", "deadline_ms": 800},
    {"id": "t.ask", "calls": {"claude": ["AskUserQuestion"]}, "who": "main", "match": null,
     "match_flags": "", "judge": true, "deny": "", "wants": ["prompts"],
     "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.dot", "calls": {"claude": ["mcp__a.b__*"]}, "who": "any", "match": null,
     "match_flags": "", "judge": false, "deny": "the a.b server is off", "wants": [],
     "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.word", "calls": {"claude": ["Grep"], "codex": ["mcp__search__grep"]},
     "who": "any", "match": {"pattern": "^\\w+$"}, "match_flags": "", "judge": true,
     "deny": "", "wants": [], "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.two", "calls": {"claude": ["Read"]}, "who": "any",
     "match": {"file_path": "secret", "mode": "^(raw|bytes)$"}, "match_flags": "",
     "judge": true, "deny": "", "wants": [], "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500},
    {"id": "t.patch", "calls": {"claude": ["Write", "Edit"], "codex": ["apply_patch"]},
     "who": "any", "match": {"file_path": "\\.env$"}, "match_flags": "", "judge": false,
     "deny": "no .env writes", "wants": [], "on_error": "allow", "deadline_ms": 500}
  ],
  "cases": [
    {"name": "no guard on: nothing covers", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "rm -rf build"}, "on": [],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a plain command no match finds", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "ls -la"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a removal is asked", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "rm -rf build", "description": "clean"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": ["t.shell-rm"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.shell-rm"]},
    {"name": "a word boundary: farm is not rm", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "farm --all"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "the whole tool name: BashOutput is not Bash", "harness": "claude", "tool": "BashOutput",
     "agent": null, "input": {"command": "rm x"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a field that is not a string never matches", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash",
     "agent": null, "input": {"command": 5}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a missing field never matches", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"description": "rm"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "who agents: the main loop's Agent call runs", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Agent",
     "agent": null, "input": {"prompt": "go"}, "on": ["t.nested"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "who agents: a subagent's Agent call is refused with no trip", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "Agent", "agent": "a-1", "input": {"prompt": "go"}, "on": ["t.nested"],
     "covering": ["t.nested"], "decision": "deny", "deny": "subagents may not start subagents"},
    {"name": "an empty agent id is the main loop", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Task",
     "agent": "", "input": {}, "on": ["t.nested"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a family pattern covers the family", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__create_event", "agent": null, "input": {},
     "on": ["t.calendar"], "covering": ["t.calendar"], "decision": "deny",
     "deny": "the calendar tools are off here"},
    {"name": "a star matches an empty run", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "mcp__Google_Calendar__list", "agent": null, "input": {},
     "on": ["t.calendar"], "covering": ["t.calendar"], "decision": "deny",
     "deny": "the calendar tools are off here"},
    {"name": "a family pattern leaves other servers alone", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "mcp__claude_ai_Gmail__send_message", "agent": null, "input": {},
     "on": ["t.calendar"], "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "the ceiling covers any subagent call", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Read",
     "agent": "a-2", "input": {"file_path": "/x"}, "on": ["t.ceiling"],
     "covering": ["t.ceiling"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.ceiling"]},
    {"name": "the ceiling leaves the main loop alone", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Read",
     "agent": null, "input": {"file_path": "/x"}, "on": ["t.ceiling"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "two judge guards are asked together, in table order", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "Bash", "agent": "a-1", "input": {"command": "rm -rf x"},
     "on": ["t.ceiling", "t.nested", "t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": ["t.shell-rm", "t.ceiling"], "decision": "ask",
     "ask": ["t.shell-rm", "t.ceiling"]},
    {"name": "a data-only refusal comes first, with no trip", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Agent",
     "agent": "a-1", "input": {}, "on": ["t.nested", "t.ceiling"],
     "covering": ["t.nested", "t.ceiling"], "decision": "deny",
     "deny": "subagents may not start subagents"},
    {"name": "case-blind match", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "GIT  Push origin"}, "on": ["t.push"],
     "covering": ["t.push"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.push"]},
    {"name": "an anchored match misses a leading space", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash",
     "agent": null, "input": {"command": " git push"}, "on": ["t.push"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "\\b ends the word: pushed is not push", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Bash",
     "agent": null, "input": {"command": "git pushed"}, "on": ["t.push"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "who main: the person's question", "harness": "claude", "tool": "AskUserQuestion",
     "agent": null, "input": {"questions": []}, "on": ["t.ask"],
     "covering": ["t.ask"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.ask"]},
    {"name": "who main: a subagent's question is not covered", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "AskUserQuestion", "agent": "a-3", "input": {"questions": []}, "on": ["t.ask"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a dot in a pattern is only a dot", "harness": "claude", "tool": "mcp__aXb__x",
     "agent": null, "input": {}, "on": ["t.dot"], "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "a dot in a pattern matches a dot", "harness": "claude", "tool": "mcp__a.b__x",
     "agent": null, "input": {}, "on": ["t.dot"], "covering": ["t.dot"], "decision": "deny",
     "deny": "the a.b server is off"},
    {"name": "\\w is ASCII", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Grep", "agent": null,
     "input": {"pattern": "hello_2"}, "on": ["t.word"],
     "covering": ["t.word"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.word"]},
    {"name": "\\w is ASCII: an accented letter is not a word character", "harness": "claude",
     "tool": "Grep", "agent": null, "input": {"pattern": "café"}, "on": ["t.word"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "every match field must find", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Read", "agent": null,
     "input": {"file_path": "/home/x/secret.txt", "mode": "raw"}, "on": ["t.two"],
     "covering": ["t.two"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.two"]},
    {"name": "one match field missing", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Read", "agent": null,
     "input": {"file_path": "/home/x/secret.txt"}, "on": ["t.two"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "one match field not found", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Read", "agent": null,
     "input": {"file_path": "/home/x/secret.txt", "mode": "rawer"}, "on": ["t.two"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "two patterns of one guard", "harness": "claude", "tool": "Edit", "agent": null,
     "input": {"file_path": "/w/.env", "old_string": "a"}, "on": ["t.patch"],
     "covering": ["t.patch"], "decision": "deny", "deny": "no .env writes"},
    {"name": "codex: a removal is asked", "harness": "codex", "tool": "Bash", "agent": null,
     "input": {"command": "rm -rf build"}, "on": ["t.shell-rm"],
     "covering": ["t.shell-rm"], "decision": "ask", "ask": ["t.shell-rm"]},
    {"name": "codex: a subagent's spawn_agent is refused", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "spawn_agent", "agent": "019a-sub", "input": {"message": "go"},
     "on": ["t.nested"], "covering": ["t.nested"], "decision": "deny",
     "deny": "subagents may not start subagents"},
    {"name": "codex: Claude's name Agent covers nothing on Codex", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "Agent", "agent": "019a-sub", "input": {}, "on": ["t.nested"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "codex: a guard with no codex calls is not in its table", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "AskUserQuestion", "agent": null, "input": {}, "on": ["t.ask"],
     "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "codex: apply_patch has no file_path, so the match misses", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "apply_patch", "agent": null, "input": {"input": "*** Begin Patch .env"},
     "on": ["t.patch"], "covering": [], "decision": "next"},
    {"name": "codex: an MCP tool by its canonical name", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "mcp__search__grep", "agent": null, "input": {"pattern": "abc"},
     "on": ["t.word", "t.calendar"], "covering": ["t.word"], "decision": "ask",
     "ask": ["t.word"]},
    {"name": "codex: the ceiling covers a subagent's call", "harness": "codex",
     "tool": "Bash", "agent": "019a-sub", "input": {"command": "ls"},
     "on": ["t.ceiling", "t.shell-rm"], "covering": ["t.ceiling"], "decision": "ask",
     "ask": ["t.ceiling"]}
  ]
}
